SUMMARY:🧩 Crimson Desert · Charting the Unknown
DESCRIPTION:Game: Crimson Desert\nType: Dlc\nStatus: Confirmed\n\nRevised r
 elease date replaces the original October 15 announcement after a two-week
  delay. Official release time: October 29\, 2026 at 22:00 UTC\, or 23:00 E
 urope/Prague (CET). The publisher notice incorrectly labels the European t
 imezone CEST for this date.\n\nLatest news:\nPearl Abyss delayed the Chart
 ing the Unknown DLC by two weeks to October 29\, 2026\, to improve polish 
 and stability. The revised release time is 22:00 UTC\, which is 23:00 in P
 rague.\n\nNews source:\nhttps://crimsondesert.pearlabyss.com/en-US/News/No
 tice/Detail?_boardNo=134\n\nEvent source:\nhttps://crimsondesert.pearlabys
 s.com/en-US/News/Notice/Detail?_boardNo=134\n\nSource start: 2026-10-29T22
 :00:00Z\nSource timezone: UTC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
