DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261020
SUMMARY:🚀 Gray Zone Warfare · Rogue Ops 0.5 Supporter Preview
DESCRIPTION:Game: Gray Zone Warfare\nType: Early Access\nStatus: Confirmed\
 n\nEarly preview of the major Rogue Ops update\, available to Supporter Ed
 ition owners only. This is a preview milestone\, not the public update rel
 ease or a new base-game launch. Launch time has not been announced in this
  source.\n\nLatest news:\nRogue Ops brings Hideout and crafting systems\, 
 multiple playable characters\, and major gameplay improvements as the game
  enters alpha. The update uses a soft wipe that retains progression but re
 sets lockers and money. Supporter Preview begins October 19\, followed by 
 the public update on October 22\, 2026.\n\nNews source:\nhttps://www.grayz
 onewarfare.com/news/player-driven-improvements-rogue-ops\n\nEvent source:\
 nhttps://www.grayzonewarfare.com/news/update-05-teaser
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
