SUMMARY:🎮 Path of Exile 2 · Full Release 1.0
DESCRIPTION:Game: Path of Exile 2\nType: Release\nStatus: Confirmed\n\nLeav
 es Early Access and becomes free-to-play\, introducing the Duelist. The pu
 blisher announces December 11 in Pacific Time\; an exact launch hour was n
 ot verified\, so this all-day entry uses the announced date.\n\nLatest new
 s:\nGrinding Gear Games announced that Path of Exile 2 will leave Early Ac
 cess and launch free-to-play on December 11\, 2026. The full release intro
 duces the Duelist class.\n\nNews source:\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/n
 ews/app/2694490/view/714536220261090882\n\nEvent source:\nhttps://store.st
 eampowered.com/news/app/2694490/view/714536220261090882
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
